{"ref":"BDB, אֲבִינָדָב","hw":"אֲבִינָדָב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִינָדָב</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>my father is noble</em><strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a man of Gibeah in whose house the ark tarried <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 7:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.7.1\">1 S 7:1</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.3\">2 S 6:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.4\">4</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 13:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.13.7\">1 Ch 13:7</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a son of Jesse <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.8\">1 S 16:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.13\">17:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.11\">1 K 4:11</a> (? perhaps otherwise unknown; Klo proposes <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִינֵר בְּ</span>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  a son of Saul <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.2\">1 S 31:2</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.33\">1 Ch 8:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.39\">9:39</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.2\">10:2</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲבִינֹ֫עַם","prev":"BDB, אֲבִימֶ֫לֶךְ"}